ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Photoshop file.
It is a text brief saved as .psd so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Photoshop to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Sfumato
Board: /styles/sfumato
Companions: sfumato-starter.html, sfumato-study.ai, sfumato-study.psd

Document
2400 × 3000 px, 300 ppi, color. Ground filled #1a120c, not left transparent.

Layer stack, top to bottom
- Labels (two words maximum, plain sans)
- Air, soft light, low opacity, gray-green #6e7c74
- Mouth and eye, softer than the midtones
- Flesh glazes, three layers, normal blend, 8–15% opacity
- Shadow mass #3a2a22
- Ground

Rules
Normal and soft light only. No hard drop shadow. No outer stroke. No copied painting under the stack.
